WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:08.620 --> 00:00:10.620
It's gonna be the best vacation ever

00:00:15.160 --> 00:00:16.860
Seriously you have to try

00:00:16.860 --> 00:00:18.860
I don't even know how to dive

00:00:18.860 --> 00:00:19.620
It's totally save

00:00:19.900 --> 00:00:20.400
Okay

00:00:22.000 --> 00:00:24.400
It's like you're going to the zoo except you're in the cage

00:00:24.400 --> 00:00:25.980
I don't know about this

00:00:25.980 --> 00:00:26.800
welcome aboard

00:00:29.920 --> 00:00:30.900
There! Look

00:00:30.900 --> 00:00:31.600
It's huge

00:00:32.400 --> 00:00:36.100
Remember, the faster you breathe the faster you use up your air.

00:00:36.100 --> 00:00:38.700
Trust me. Once you're down there, you're not gonna want to come back up

00:00:41.260 --> 00:00:41.780
This is amazing

00:00:42.240 --> 00:00:44.320
It kinda takes your breath away

00:00:44.360 --> 00:00:45.220
Oh my god

00:00:45.760 --> 00:00:46.580
It's the biggest shark!

00:00:47.920 --> 00:00:49.920
Will you take a picture of me?

00:00:49.960 --> 00:00:50.800
Sorry, sorry!

00:00:53.840 --> 00:00:55.380
We would like to come back up now

00:00:55.380 --> 00:00:56.260
We're bringing you back up

00:00:58.300 --> 00:00:59.280
oh my god

00:01:06.420 --> 00:01:07.620
I'm so scared

00:01:09.960 --> 00:01:11.580
We need to get you some air

00:01:11.620 --> 00:01:12.560
How deep are we?

00:01:12.560 --> 00:01:13.580
47 meters

00:01:15.680 --> 00:01:16.820
Hello is anyone there?

00:01:16.820 --> 00:01:18.360
Please someone answer me!

00:01:18.760 --> 00:01:20.620
We need to get back up to the top

00:01:25.160 --> 00:01:25.800
Can you hear me?

00:01:25.800 --> 00:01:27.800
We're gonna send down extra air tanks

00:01:28.960 --> 00:01:29.680
I'm so lost

00:01:32.520 --> 00:01:33.560
Stay in the cage

00:01:33.900 --> 00:01:34.760
We have no air

00:01:34.840 --> 00:01:35.880
We have to go now

00:01:39.360 --> 00:01:40.600
There are sharks everywhere!

00:01:50.480 --> 00:01:52.480
47 Meters Down

